# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# TOON faucet box .env — copy to .env and fill in secrets.
#
# This box has NO connector and NO ILP config of any kind (§4.5) — there is no
# TOON_MNEMONIC, no signer key, no settlement key here. Every secret below is
# generated FRESH ON THIS BOX (§4.4). Do NOT copy a key from box 1's .env: a
# copied key exists in two places for as long as the old box does.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# Public domain (MUST match the DNS A-record for faucet.*)
DOMAIN=devnet.toonprotocol.dev

# Let's Encrypt — set to 0 for trusted prod certs (after DNS resolves)
LETSENCRYPT_STAGING=0
LETSENCRYPT_EMAIL=dev.jonathan.green@gmail.com

# ── SECRETS — all fresh, all generated on this box ───────────────────────────
# NEVER commit real values here — not to this file, not to any other. This
# file is tracked in a public repository; anything written here is published
# the moment it is pushed. Keep real values in this box's untracked .env (see
# .gitignore) or in a secret manager, and rotate immediately if one ever lands
# in a commit.

# Base Sepolia faucet key (EVM 0x… private key), generated fresh. Mints the
# ungated mock USDC on the PUBLIC Base Sepolia testnet (chainId 84532) —
# mint() coins fresh tokens so the key needs NO USDC balance, only Base
# Sepolia ETH for gas. Leave blank to disable the Base Sepolia leg (POST
# /api/base-sepolia/request returns 503).
BASE_SEPOLIA_FAUCET_KEY=

# Solana USDC treasury keypair — NOT an env var. Generate a fresh keypair on
# this box and place it at /root/keys/solana-usdc-treasury.json (the path
# docker-compose.faucet.yml bind-mounts into the container). A missing file
# disables only the Solana leg; it does not fail the container. Fund it with
# USDC on the public Solana devnet before use — SOL is needed only for tx fees
# (this box dispenses USDC only; it airdrops no SOL — §4.6).
#   /root/keys/solana-usdc-treasury.json

# Mina USDC transfer-drip (o1js proving), generated fresh. Legacy alias
# MINA_USDC_ADMIN_KEY is accepted but MINA_USDC_TREASURY_KEY is the current
# name — see packages/faucet/src/mina-usdc.mjs. Leave blank to disable the
# Mina USDC leg (POST /api/mina/usdc-request returns 503). There is no native-
# MINA leg on this box at all (§4.6), so there is no MINA_FAUCET_KEY here.
MINA_USDC_TREASURY_KEY=
MINA_USDC_TOKEN=
MINA_USDC_ADMIN_CONTRACT=
